# Weight profile ornith-1.5-122b-exl3-4.0: Ornith-1.5-122B (MIT) in our EXL3 pack at 4.0 bpw: every projection at 4 bits,
# head 6, MTP layer 4, vision tower 6 (exllamav3 1.6.2, mul1 codebook; 64.6 GB), converted from ornith-ai/Ornith-1.5-122B
# at revision e09bc0dfbe. Against the BF16 checkpoint's logits (8 wikitext rows x 1,024, this engine): KL 0.139,
# top-1 86.2 %, ppl 7.27 against BF16's 7.09. Drafts with the pack's MTP layer and the lookup, cut by StairCut from this
# pack's price file. Measured on the Spark (2026-10-20, greedy, thinking off, one fresh server a row): plain 37.6 / 38.4 /
# 37.8 / 38.0 / 38.1 tok/s on prose / code / chat / edit / copy asks (512 tokens), this profile 85.3 / 114.2 / 110.0 /
# 115.9 / 124.8, and a 2,048-token game file 37.2 plain, 103.3 here; every text the plain run's. The pack is in a private
# Hugging Face repository (a download needs a token with access).
# Switch with ops/use-profile.sh ornith-1.5-122b-exl3-4.0.
QSE_ORN_VARIANT=exl3-4.0
QSE_WEIGHTS_HF=0xBakeer/TandemLLM-Ornith-1.5-122B-EXL3-4.0
QSE_WEIGHTS_REVISION=9e73dddc081cc178408bdb79025d7fcbca1ffd6c
QSE_WEIGHTS_GB=64.6
# the draft head: mtp (the pack's MTP layer, depth 3) or dflash2 (the DFlash2 drafter for Ornith, models/ornith-1.5-122b/
# model.yaml fetches it; with NVFP4 projections and the hot head 96.8 tok/s on the game file, 2.86 GiB allocated)
QSE_ORN_HEAD=${QSE_ORN_HEAD:-mtp}
QSE_ORN_DFLASH2=${HOME}/models/ornith-1.5-122b-dflash2
QSE_ASSETS=$([ "${QSE_ORN_HEAD}" = dflash2 ] && echo "${QSE_ORN_DFLASH2}/model.safetensors" || true)
QWEN38_Q35M_DFLASH2_NVFP4=1
QWEN38_Q35M_DFLASH2_HOT=1
# after a round cut to the anchor alone, 1, 2, 4, 8 rounds take the plain step without a draft
QWEN38_Q35M_ANCHOR_BACKOFF=8
# MemAvailable (GiB) a start needs: the weights with the MTP layer (61.16 allocated), the engine and its graphs, the KV at
# 262,144 tokens, the allocator, the prefill workspace and the 15 GiB floor
QSE_MEM_NEED_GIB=93
# the engine's limits (SRV-655): the load (62.1 allocated: weights, MTP layer, engine, vision) + the runtime (3.5: the
# graphs and attention partials of every context class, measured after a 59k-token chat) + the KV at 262,144 tokens
# (6.5, the pool's: the policy takes it off again) + the caches (10, as serve.env's 70 sizes them for the 27B: the end
# anchor, the resident anchors, the guest stash, the park) + 2 of allocator reserve. At 74 the caches had no room at all
# (live 2026-10-20: 65.5 GiB allocated against 74 - 6.5 - 2 slack): every end anchor, stash, park and store entry was
# refused, a 55k-token turn was refused for memory and its chat compacted five times at 42k tokens. Peak: the ceiling +
# the prefill workspace (6; a long prefill gives caches back first). MemAvailable at the peak with every cache full:
# about 15 GiB of the box's 121.6
MEM_CEILING_GIB=84
MEM_PEAK_GIB=90
. "${REPO}/ops/profiles/_ornith.env"
